			"notes": "## Added\n- Option tooltips in the in-game config screen\n- Color picker for the chat text color\n- Every option in `config/wynnbubbles.json5` now has a comment explaining it, so you can edit the file in any text editor\n\n## Changed\n- Cloth Config and Mod Menu are now optional. Without them, settings live in `config/wynnbubbles.json5`. With both installed, the in-game config screen works as before\n- Your existing config file keeps working, no changes needed\n\n## Fixed\n- Small gap in the bottom-right corner of chat bubbles next to the arrow"
